Chapter: MutLaunderAlias
  cites Foreword chapter Linear

 Probe (closed by LinearOwnership stage 2): aliasing a mutable record
 param to a let-local is a MOVE; the local's consumes are tracked.
 Handing the record to two owners through the alias is CDX2062.

Section: Definitions

  mutable Counter = record {
   value : Integer
  }

  pass-on : Counter -> Counter
  pass-on (c) = c

  double-owner : Counter -> Integer
  double-owner (m) = let m2 = m
   in let a = pass-on m2
   in let b = pass-on m2
   in a.value + b.value

  opening : Text = show (double-owner (Counter { value = 21 }))

